{"4857490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PlankTap","steam_appid":4857490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Jellyfish on Your Desktop<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up the game, and a jellyfish floats onto your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No annoying windows, no taskbar icon. It just quietly floats there. Once you've positioned and sized it with your mouse, let it be — like a tiny piece of the ocean has landed on your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can drag it anywhere — a corner, the edge of your screen. Scroll to resize — as small as nearly invisible, or as big as, well, impressively big.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Type, It Earns<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It knows when you're typing (mouse clicks count too).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type slowly and it sways gently. Type faster and it starts swaying excitedly, its expression changing along the way. Oh, and every keystroke also earns you a coin. Every little bit counts!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/0397e20a42dea398b021aea26a72a4cc.poster.avif?t=1793682314\" width=844 height=782 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/0397e20a42dea398b021aea26a72a4cc.webm?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/0397e20a42dea398b021aea26a72a4cc.mp4?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's a Stock Market Under the Sea<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to do with all those coins? Trade stocks!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven virtual stocks with underwater names. Their prices shift every few minutes, influenced by all kinds of factors — so remember to glance at the tips your little jellyfish brings you from time to time!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the chart, check your portfolio, then buy and sell. You can sneak a peek between tasks, then get right back to work. A quick dip during your workday is all you need to get that done.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rumors Pop Up on Their Own<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a bubble pops up above Jelly's head.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rumor has it the thermal vent region has been unstable lately.&quot; &quot;Coral growth seems to have accelerated noticeably.&quot; All kinds of underwater gossip, appearing at random — some bullish, some bearish.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rumor won't affect prices immediately though — there's a short delay. Rumors need time to brew, and you need time to act and get positioned early.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/2a8500a90397f51f378a1796a7d289af.poster.avif?t=1793682314\" width=966 height=1080 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/2a8500a90397f51f378a1796a7d289af.webm?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/2a8500a90397f51f378a1796a7d289af.mp4?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress Up Your Jellyfish<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can also go toward something else: the skin shop (or maybe trading stocks is really just a means to buy more skins).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've prepared a whole wardrobe of weird and wonderful skins — seasons, desserts, starry sky, pearl, mushroom, volcano, diamond, robot, cyber, ancient.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prices vary, but unlocking them all will take quite a stash of coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Use It<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlankTap isn't some big production. It's just a little desktop companion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it's open, you can go do your own thing. It just floats there beside you. It moves when you type, zones out when you're away. Earn a few coins, check the market, maybe switch a skin.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No daily tasks. No stamina system. Nothing you *have* to do. It's just there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just being cute. That's it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/89f33cf2191e8cf90062e0b1113ab52b.poster.avif?t=1793682314\" width=898 height=854 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/89f33cf2191e8cf90062e0b1113ab52b.webm?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/89f33cf2191e8cf90062e0b1113ab52b.mp4?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🐙 A cartoon jellyfish living on your desktop — transparent window, no pop-ups, no distractions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ⌨️ Typing drives its movements — the faster you type, the more excited it gets, and it earns coins too<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 📈 Underwater stock market — seven virtual stocks with logical price movements, experience virtual trading<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 💬 Random rumors — bubbles pop up, hinting at where the market might go<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🎨 Fifteen skins — unlock with in-game coins, no microtransactions required!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🖥️ Multi-monitor support — the jellyfish can roam freely across displays<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🌐 Four languages — Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Jellyfish on Your Desktop<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up the game, and a jellyfish floats onto your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No annoying windows, no taskbar icon. It just quietly floats there. Once you've positioned and sized it with your mouse, let it be — like a tiny piece of the ocean has landed on your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can drag it anywhere — a corner, the edge of your screen. Scroll to resize — as small as nearly invisible, or as big as, well, impressively big.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Type, It Earns<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It knows when you're typing (mouse clicks count too).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type slowly and it sways gently. Type faster and it starts swaying excitedly, its expression changing along the way. Oh, and every keystroke also earns you a coin. Every little bit counts!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/0397e20a42dea398b021aea26a72a4cc.poster.avif?t=1793682314\" width=844 height=782 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/0397e20a42dea398b021aea26a72a4cc.webm?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/0397e20a42dea398b021aea26a72a4cc.mp4?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's a Stock Market Under the Sea<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to do with all those coins? Trade stocks!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven virtual stocks with underwater names. Their prices shift every few minutes, influenced by all kinds of factors — so remember to glance at the tips your little jellyfish brings you from time to time!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the chart, check your portfolio, then buy and sell. You can sneak a peek between tasks, then get right back to work. A quick dip during your workday is all you need to get that done.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rumors Pop Up on Their Own<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a bubble pops up above Jelly's head.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rumor has it the thermal vent region has been unstable lately.&quot; &quot;Coral growth seems to have accelerated noticeably.&quot; All kinds of underwater gossip, appearing at random — some bullish, some bearish.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rumor won't affect prices immediately though — there's a short delay. Rumors need time to brew, and you need time to act and get positioned early.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/2a8500a90397f51f378a1796a7d289af.poster.avif?t=1793682314\" width=966 height=1080 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/2a8500a90397f51f378a1796a7d289af.webm?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/2a8500a90397f51f378a1796a7d289af.mp4?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress Up Your Jellyfish<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can also go toward something else: the skin shop (or maybe trading stocks is really just a means to buy more skins).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've prepared a whole wardrobe of weird and wonderful skins — seasons, desserts, starry sky, pearl, mushroom, volcano, diamond, robot, cyber, ancient.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prices vary, but unlocking them all will take quite a stash of coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Use It<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlankTap isn't some big production. It's just a little desktop companion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it's open, you can go do your own thing. It just floats there beside you. It moves when you type, zones out when you're away. Earn a few coins, check the market, maybe switch a skin.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No daily tasks. No stamina system. Nothing you *have* to do. It's just there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just being cute. That's it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/89f33cf2191e8cf90062e0b1113ab52b.poster.avif?t=1793682314\" width=898 height=854 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/89f33cf2191e8cf90062e0b1113ab52b.webm?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/extras\/89f33cf2191e8cf90062e0b1113ab52b.mp4?t=1793682314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🐙 A cartoon jellyfish living on your desktop — transparent window, no pop-ups, no distractions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ⌨️ Typing drives its movements — the faster you type, the more excited it gets, and it earns coins too<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 📈 Underwater stock market — seven virtual stocks with logical price movements, experience virtual trading<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 💬 Random rumors — bubbles pop up, hinting at where the market might go<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🎨 Fifteen skins — unlock with in-game coins, no microtransactions required!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🖥️ Multi-monitor support — the jellyfish can roam freely across displays<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🌐 Four languages — Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"There's a cartoon jellyfish living on your desktop. It floats above your windows, makes coins while you type, then trades underwater stocks and unlocks more skins. It won't interrupt your work. It's just there to be cute. That's it.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/5661cad0479e8150c5c88db714fba36b5ed290dd\/header.jpg?t=1793682314","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/5c6883a5cf0809efe153007145ac0239431c0dea\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793682314","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/5c6883a5cf0809efe153007145ac0239431c0dea\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793682314","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7~11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 256 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> None<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10~11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> None<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["CrowZ Games"],"publishers":["CrowZ Games","FHNBHJ"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":209,"final":156,"discount_percent":25,"initial_formatted":"2,09€","final_formatted":"1,56€"},"packages":[1687103],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy PlankTap","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1687103,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"PlankTap - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">2,09€<\/span> 1,56€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":156}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/e624dc42d3f2d78a958b07873d07badd10e683d3\/ss_e624dc42d3f2d78a958b07873d07badd10e683d3.600x338.jpg?t=1793682314","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/e624dc42d3f2d78a958b07873d07badd10e683d3\/ss_e624dc42d3f2d78a958b07873d07badd10e683d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793682314"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/aa3151fe9027496420bca8222a238323881f4ed2\/ss_aa3151fe9027496420bca8222a238323881f4ed2.600x338.jpg?t=1793682314","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/aa3151fe9027496420bca8222a238323881f4ed2\/ss_aa3151fe9027496420bca8222a238323881f4ed2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793682314"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/ec2d82f03262d04ffef8f6077c5aa031c84729b0\/ss_ec2d82f03262d04ffef8f6077c5aa031c84729b0.600x338.jpg?t=1793682314","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/ec2d82f03262d04ffef8f6077c5aa031c84729b0\/ss_ec2d82f03262d04ffef8f6077c5aa031c84729b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793682314"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/f72c5f5a2d6eabc80a45a7aff2ca742bc52a0bca\/ss_f72c5f5a2d6eabc80a45a7aff2ca742bc52a0bca.600x338.jpg?t=1793682314","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/f72c5f5a2d6eabc80a45a7aff2ca742bc52a0bca\/ss_f72c5f5a2d6eabc80a45a7aff2ca742bc52a0bca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793682314"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/eae22cb18b6eb8d5f899cc3c148dc662d3c3ac99\/ss_eae22cb18b6eb8d5f899cc3c148dc662d3c3ac99.600x338.jpg?t=1793682314","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/eae22cb18b6eb8d5f899cc3c148dc662d3c3ac99\/ss_eae22cb18b6eb8d5f899cc3c148dc662d3c3ac99.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793682314"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/34afd9dc91afd6228682a1f5f553549a5eb9315a\/ss_34afd9dc91afd6228682a1f5f553549a5eb9315a.600x338.jpg?t=1793682314","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/34afd9dc91afd6228682a1f5f553549a5eb9315a\/ss_34afd9dc91afd6228682a1f5f553549a5eb9315a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793682314"}],"movies":[{"id":257368488,"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257368488\/7613f3956ef6204fea077a678c04b9c20a11e2dd\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782840143","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4857490\/1255966427\/74f4c68416a083054c87d5d14096a186344f2ee7\/1782838282\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1782840143","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4857490\/1255966427\/74f4c68416a083054c87d5d14096a186344f2ee7\/1782838282\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1782840143","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4857490\/1255966427\/74f4c68416a083054c87d5d14096a186344f2ee7\/1782838282\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782840143","highlight":true}],"achievements":{"total":7,"highlighted":[{"icon":"98f434a2355aa3e383ed217371c2a1953142f651.jpg","localized_name":"First Trade","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"First Trade","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/98f434a2355aa3e383ed217371c2a1953142f651.jpg"},{"icon":"e433206d32fdebc4115b09d7cfa5aa3d3ff1899b.jpg","localized_name":"Cash Out","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Cash Out","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/e433206d32fdebc4115b09d7cfa5aa3d3ff1899b.jpg"},{"icon":"b1c78690d10ce60b36258d4c468392d5ada9acac.jpg","localized_name":"Ten Thousand Coins","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Ten Thousand Coins","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/b1c78690d10ce60b36258d4c468392d5ada9acac.jpg"},{"icon":"7e371eb39c7d0658c4db2434b4924b2e66f80b1e.jpg","localized_name":"Diversified","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Diversified","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/7e371eb39c7d0658c4db2434b4924b2e66f80b1e.jpg"},{"icon":"8d3cf6508c3c8423612f5d5d17a82d6079657934.jpg","localized_name":"Skin Collector","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Skin Collector","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/8d3cf6508c3c8423612f5d5d17a82d6079657934.jpg"},{"icon":"2edf0ee736aed35e9b78f6098d431817f2687b85.jpg","localized_name":"Together","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Together","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/2edf0ee736aed35e9b78f6098d431817f2687b85.jpg"},{"icon":"df58debec8c0b07f221ab462b69cda47bfb07c76.jpg","localized_name":"Dress Up","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Dress Up","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4857490\/df58debec8c0b07f221ab462b69cda47bfb07c76.jpg"}]},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"2 Nov, 2026"},"support_info":{"url":"https:\/\/x.com\/virggle","email":"1321823505@qq.com"},"background":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/4857490?t=1793682314","background_raw":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4857490\/372e77b08c0a6af3888f116121d3d65ae0a744c7\/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793682314","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"l","required_age":"0","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"0","required_age":"0","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""},"igrs":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"3","required_age":"0","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""}}}}}